"GhostTuning.hover_hold_acceleration": "How fast (m/s per second) a held raise/lower input (PageUp/PageDown, gamepad) speeds up while held.",
"GhostTuning.hover_hold_max_speed": "Top speed (m/s) a held raise/lower input ramps up to.",
