"DiscBodyVisuals.band_roughness": "Roughness of the disc's side band material.",
"DiscBodyVisuals.bottom_cap_enabled": "Whether a flat cap closes the side band's underside.",
"DiscBodyVisuals.band_radius_scale": "How far the side band's own outline (and the chamfer's own bottom/outer edge) is scaled out from field_radius, so it never z-fights the top surface's own CylinderMesh side wall; also sets how far the chamfer visibly slopes outward.",
"DiscBodyVisuals.segments": "Radial segments the disc's side band/chamfer outline is walked in; higher reads as a smoother circle at a close grazing angle.",
"DiscBodyVisuals.surface_anisotropy": "Strength of the disc band/chamfer's brushed-metal anisotropic specular streak, running around the disc's circumference. 0 disables it for a plain isotropic highlight.",
"DiscBodyVisuals.surface_noise_strength": "Strength of the procedural fine-noise normal map on the disc's band/chamfer surface; higher reads as a more visible micro-texture in the sun's specular sheen. 0 disables the bump entirely.",
